{
  "job_B1.3.29_20261116_195027": {
    "chunk_text": "He het \u00f0a \u00feone halgan bisceop unscrydan, and unm\u00e6\u00f0lice swingan, and he sang his gebeda betwux Eft \u00fea Sisinnius het swingan \u00feone m\u00e6ssepreost, and eac \u00feone diacon, Dionisies geferan, and het hi He het hi eft swingan, and si\u00f0\u00f0an \u00feone bisceop on isenum bedde astrehte, and byrnenda gleda dyde \u00dea het se w\u00e6lhreowa hine wurpan deorum \u00fee w\u00e6ron ofhingrode \u00fe\u00e6t hi \u00feone halgan wer abiton, ac \u00fea \u00dea het se dema awurpan \u00feone Drihtnes \u00f0\u00e6gen into byrnendum ofne, ac his gebedu adwescton ealne Git \u00fea se w\u00e6lhreowa dema het wyrcan ane hencgene, and het hon \u00feone bisceop to bismore \u00fe\u00e6ron, and \u00dea het se dema eft don hine of \u00fe\u00e6re hencgene, and l\u00e6dan hi ealle \u00fery to leohtleasum cwearterne, and Hw\u00e6t \u00f0a se bisceop bli\u00f0elice tihte mid lare \u00fea Cristenan on \u00feam cwearterne to Gode, and him eallum \u00de\u00e6r com eac se H\u00e6lend mid \u00feam heofonlican leohte, and fela engla mid him, \u00fe\u00e6r menn onlocodon, Ongin nu stranglice, and \u00fein gemynd stent on heorunge, seo lufu and welwillendnys \u00fee wuna\u00f0 on Sisinnius eft het sona \u00fe\u00e6s on mergen gefeccan \u00fea halgan of \u00feam fulum cwearterne, and het geoffrian \u00dea halgan \u00fea \u00feurhwunodon on \u00f0\u00e6s H\u00e6lendes geleafan, and se woda dema wolde \u00fea git cunnian, gif he \u00dea l\u00e6ddon \u00fea h\u00e6\u00f0enan \u00fea halgan to sl\u00e6ge,",
